<p>The status column shows AnnexKit's auto-population status for each Annex IV requirement: <span class="status status-auto">AUTO</span> (auto from runtime or declaration), <span class="status status-partial">PARTIAL</span> (some data, more needed), <span class="status status-manual">MANUAL</span> (provider/legal-team input required).</p>

<table>
