    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

{# ============================== APPENDIX B ============================== #}
<h1>Appendix B — Glossary / Glossario</h1>
<dl>
  <dt><strong>AI Act</strong></dt><dd>Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 of the European Parliament and of the Council on artificial intelligence.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Annex III</strong></dt><dd>List of high-risk AI systems by category.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Annex IV</strong></dt><dd>Required content of technical documentation for high-risk AI systems (this document's structure).</dd>
  <dt><strong>GPAI</strong></dt><dd>General-Purpose AI model (Article 3(63)). Subject to separate obligations under Chapter V.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Provider</strong></dt><dd>Article 3(3) — natural or legal person that develops an AI system or has it developed and places it on the market under its own name.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Deployer</strong></dt><dd>Article 3(4) — natural or legal person using an AI system under its authority. Previously called "user" in earlier drafts.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Authorised representative</strong></dt><dd>Article 3(5) — required for non-EU-established providers (Article 22).</dd>
  <dt><strong>Conformity assessment</strong></dt><dd>Article 43 — procedure demonstrating compliance for high-risk systems before market placement.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Post-market monitoring</strong></dt><dd>Article 72 — provider obligation to systematically collect and analyse data on system performance throughout its lifetime.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Article 5</strong></dt><dd>Prohibited AI practices.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Article 6 + Annex III</strong></dt><dd>High-risk classification.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Article 9</strong></dt><dd>Risk management system.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Article 12</strong></dt><dd>Record-keeping (logs).</dd>
  <dt><strong>Article 13</strong></dt><dd>Transparency and information for deployers.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Article 14</strong></dt><dd>Human oversight.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Article 26</strong></dt><dd>Deployer obligations for high-risk systems.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Article 27</strong></dt><dd>Fundamental rights impact assessment.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Article 47</strong></dt><dd>EU declaration of conformity.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Article 50</strong></dt><dd>Transparency obligations for certain AI systems.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Article 72</strong></dt><dd>Post-market monitoring.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Article 73</strong></dt><dd>Serious incident reporting.</dd>
</dl>

